WEBVTT

00:01.042 --> 00:03.253
Hey, where's the other one?

00:03.336 --> 00:05.463
Is that fucker coming with the fuzz?

00:08.425 --> 00:10.510
You fucking teenage prick!

00:12.679 --> 00:13.596
Hey!

00:13.680 --> 00:14.889
Load it quickly.

00:14.973 --> 00:17.434
- Did you get the documents?
- I got it all.

00:17.517 --> 00:18.393
Load it up!

00:32.782 --> 00:34.451
Hey, hurry up!

00:38.621 --> 00:39.831
Come with me! Quick!

00:44.711 --> 00:45.879
Let's go!

01:00.852 --> 01:03.438
KIM GIL-SU

01:07.150 --> 01:08.318
Hey. My battery is low.

01:08.401 --> 01:10.111
Fuck you.

01:10.820 --> 01:12.197
Where are you?

01:14.616 --> 01:18.036
It's all over, so come to Mangu-dong.

01:18.119 --> 01:19.829
Bring that bitch Yeong-i.

01:24.918 --> 01:26.211
Seong-chan is here.

01:28.505 --> 01:29.339
Come quickly

01:30.340 --> 01:32.842
before I sell this boy off to someone.

01:35.303 --> 01:36.346
Understood.

01:42.018 --> 01:44.354
What is it? What about Seong-chan?

01:50.527 --> 01:52.612
I'll be back in a bit. Stay here.

01:54.280 --> 01:55.740
Find a room and lie low.

01:56.616 --> 01:57.909
Where are you going?

02:00.495 --> 02:01.579
Don't follow me.

02:03.623 --> 02:04.499
Hey!

02:11.172 --> 02:13.633
ASSHOLE

02:19.848 --> 02:21.182
What's going on?

02:21.891 --> 02:23.059
I'm at the address.

02:23.977 --> 02:25.186
There's no one here.

02:29.399 --> 02:32.902
Those bastards took Su-ho, didn't they?

02:33.820 --> 02:36.197
Add me on WithMap.

02:36.698 --> 02:37.532
What?

02:38.575 --> 02:39.868
Don't you know WithMap?

02:41.619 --> 02:43.788
Download it. Search for WithMap.

02:44.372 --> 02:46.791
Use it to track my location.

02:50.044 --> 02:51.588
What? Where are you going?

02:51.671 --> 02:52.922
I don't know yet.

02:54.716 --> 02:56.092
Bring the cops with you,

02:57.343 --> 02:58.678
or we'll die for real.

03:00.763 --> 03:01.598
Got it.

03:07.478 --> 03:08.313
Seok-dae!

03:10.732 --> 03:12.150
Take me! Don't go alone.

03:14.235 --> 03:15.320
Let's go together.

03:28.208 --> 03:29.292
It's fine!

03:30.001 --> 03:30.835
I'm going.

03:30.919 --> 03:34.255
Why did you let Su-ho go by himself?
What if something bad happens to Su-ho?

03:42.222 --> 03:44.224
YEONG-I
COME TO MANGU-DONG FIRST

03:44.307 --> 03:46.017
YOUR FRIENDS ARE THERE

04:10.416 --> 04:15.546
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 1

05:26.117 --> 05:27.201
I'm tired of it.

05:27.744 --> 05:28.995
Stop following me.

05:29.495 --> 05:30.538
Just shut up!

05:53.853 --> 05:54.687
Su-ho.

06:02.403 --> 06:03.237
Are you okay?

06:05.948 --> 06:06.783
Hey.

06:08.034 --> 06:09.410
How come you're here?

06:09.494 --> 06:11.287
I thought something happened to you.

06:12.121 --> 06:13.164
I was worried.

06:14.123 --> 06:16.084
I came to hand over the money.

06:16.167 --> 06:17.668
So now I'm here.

06:21.756 --> 06:23.800
So heartwarming! Like soup for the soul.

06:24.634 --> 06:26.719
- Hey.
- Actually, I want some soup.

06:26.803 --> 06:28.971
Shut the fuck up, dickheads.

06:29.847 --> 06:31.933
Don't be so harsh.

06:32.016 --> 06:34.435
I'm miserable enough
being tied up like this.

06:34.936 --> 06:37.188
And quit smoking, asshole. Be healthy.

06:43.528 --> 06:44.737
ASSHOLE

06:44.821 --> 06:45.655
Yeong-i.

06:47.031 --> 06:48.032
What?

06:50.618 --> 06:51.828
Don't do anything.

06:53.079 --> 06:53.913
Don't act up.

06:56.916 --> 06:58.334
You always say that.

06:59.335 --> 07:00.211
I'm sorry.

07:01.254 --> 07:03.798
It's my fault we got involved with Gil-su.

07:04.632 --> 07:06.801
This only happened because of me.

07:10.012 --> 07:10.847
Hey!

07:13.099 --> 07:14.684
Do you have a crush on me?

07:18.479 --> 07:19.313
What the hell?

07:48.009 --> 07:49.135
Hello?

07:49.969 --> 07:53.556
I'm the one who called about Mangu-dong.
Are you on your way?

08:06.110 --> 08:06.944
Come here.

08:17.330 --> 08:18.331
Hey, Seok-dae.

08:18.831 --> 08:22.084
Did I do something to upset you?

08:23.920 --> 08:26.756
I gave you food and shelter.

08:27.340 --> 08:29.175
I even paid you quite well.

08:30.259 --> 08:31.260
Why?

08:31.344 --> 08:33.763
Did you go soft now that you have a gang?

08:34.430 --> 08:35.515
Just beat me up.

08:39.352 --> 08:40.811
I'm just curious.

08:45.149 --> 08:46.067
Just punch me.

08:51.447 --> 08:52.281
All right.

08:53.741 --> 08:55.409
Then I'll hit you, fucker!

09:11.592 --> 09:12.510
Hey!

09:16.305 --> 09:19.058
- Please stop this.
- Was it you, bitch?

09:19.809 --> 09:21.018
You screwed it up.

09:23.145 --> 09:25.356
Hey, get rid of this fucking bitch.

09:27.567 --> 09:28.401
Let go!

09:29.569 --> 09:31.571
Let go of me, you fuckers!

09:36.742 --> 09:37.702
Hey, Seong-chan.

09:40.746 --> 09:41.706
Seong-chan.

09:47.795 --> 09:49.547
You're 14 this year, right?

09:50.923 --> 09:51.757
Yes.

09:57.638 --> 09:59.223
You stabbed those punks.

10:07.148 --> 10:08.691
Don't be scared.

10:09.650 --> 10:11.444
Minors don't go to prison.

10:12.153 --> 10:13.821
It's troubling.

10:21.037 --> 10:25.583
JUNGNANG-GU
YEONG-I

10:28.794 --> 10:31.964
Eeny, meeny, miny, moe.

10:32.048 --> 10:33.591
Looks like

10:33.674 --> 10:36.927
you are… it.

10:40.514 --> 10:42.016
Ding, dong, dang.

10:42.725 --> 10:43.934
Dong.

10:47.897 --> 10:48.981
Hey.

10:49.565 --> 10:51.192
We can talk this through.

10:52.193 --> 10:53.736
Shut the fuck up.

10:53.819 --> 10:55.905
This might sting a little.

10:55.988 --> 10:56.822
Okay?

11:02.578 --> 11:03.913
Fuck.

11:04.664 --> 11:07.249
That's enough, you fucking piece of trash.

11:12.046 --> 11:12.880
Seok-dae!

11:14.382 --> 11:16.717
Don't move, assholes,
or I'll kill you all.

11:22.682 --> 11:24.517
Just you and me, shithead.

11:25.184 --> 11:26.936
If you lose, then fuck off.

11:27.561 --> 11:29.689
Do I look like a fucking pushover?

11:33.401 --> 11:34.860
Son of a bitch!

11:37.697 --> 11:38.864
Fucker!

11:41.200 --> 11:43.953
Let go, asshole!

11:45.162 --> 11:46.455
Come here. Fuck!

11:46.539 --> 11:48.749
Fucking bastard.

11:48.833 --> 11:51.877
I fed you and gave you a place to stay.

12:01.762 --> 12:04.724
Stop before I beat the shit out of you,
motherfucker.

12:21.741 --> 12:23.451
Hey, Seok-dae.

12:23.534 --> 12:26.036
It's fucking fun, right?

12:26.954 --> 12:28.789
Wanna know why you're such a loser?

12:29.582 --> 12:33.586
You have gotten too damn soft,
you fucking idiot--

12:39.467 --> 12:41.135
- Fucking bitch!
- What the fuck, bitch?

12:41.218 --> 12:43.471
Give me a break, you fuckers!

12:43.554 --> 12:44.430
You bitch--

12:44.513 --> 12:46.182
Don't fucking move!

12:49.727 --> 12:50.770
Help Seok-dae.

12:52.229 --> 12:53.439
Hey, don't move!

12:53.522 --> 12:56.150
- Bitch.
- Fuck! I said don't move!

12:59.445 --> 13:01.238
Wait a minute.

13:03.240 --> 13:04.950
Hey, wait. I'm bleeding.

13:05.451 --> 13:07.328
Fucking bitch!

13:08.162 --> 13:09.371
You bitch!

13:10.372 --> 13:11.916
Die, you bitch.

13:14.794 --> 13:17.838
Seok-dae shouldn't have met you, bitch!

13:18.339 --> 13:19.256
Die!

13:27.264 --> 13:28.182
Boss!

13:44.865 --> 13:45.741
Fuck.

13:46.534 --> 13:48.369
I thought you were a fucking coward.

13:48.953 --> 13:51.539
But you've got some balls, haven't you?

13:52.915 --> 13:55.167
It's over. The cops are coming.

13:55.835 --> 13:57.461
They'll search your car.

13:57.962 --> 13:59.630
Fuck!

13:59.713 --> 14:01.048
Hey, get going.

14:05.302 --> 14:06.220
Are you okay?

14:09.223 --> 14:11.767
Si-eun, what happened?

14:12.685 --> 14:13.769
Sorry I'm late.

14:15.938 --> 14:17.731
Hey, untie us. We almost died.

14:21.694 --> 14:22.862
Gently. My arms hurt.

14:22.945 --> 14:24.029
Let's go. Quickly.

14:31.537 --> 14:33.747
I'm never going to a theme park again.

14:37.209 --> 14:38.210
They're back?

14:38.294 --> 14:39.670
Oh fuck.

14:42.131 --> 14:42.965
Hey!

14:44.049 --> 14:46.051
You're so fucking clever.

14:46.677 --> 14:48.053
You fuckers.

14:48.554 --> 14:50.055
You pair made a fool of me!

14:50.681 --> 14:51.515
Fuck.

14:52.141 --> 14:53.726
Grab these fuckers.

14:54.268 --> 14:55.102
Get them!

14:55.185 --> 14:56.770
You fooled me too.

15:14.079 --> 15:15.080
Fuck.

15:21.337 --> 15:23.380
Yeong-i. Let's go.

15:24.340 --> 15:25.257
We need to go now.

15:33.223 --> 15:34.391
The police are here!

15:34.475 --> 15:36.393
- What are you doing?
- Why?

15:36.477 --> 15:37.436
- Quickly, go!
- Why?

15:37.519 --> 15:38.354
You kids!

15:45.402 --> 15:47.613
Fucker! You son of a bitch!

15:47.696 --> 15:49.114
Fuckhead!

15:51.075 --> 15:52.618
- Out of the way.
- Fuck!

15:58.874 --> 16:00.167
Did you think

16:00.834 --> 16:02.878
I wouldn't use a knife on a brat?

16:04.213 --> 16:05.255
This is why

16:05.839 --> 16:09.593
you should have just given me the money
and then fucked off.

16:10.135 --> 16:11.887
Isn't that right?

16:15.557 --> 16:16.558
Hands up!

16:16.642 --> 16:17.851
Don't move!

16:19.853 --> 16:21.522
220, this is 43.

16:21.605 --> 16:23.023
Regarding report 2917…

16:23.107 --> 16:24.692
Fuck, I'll get you next time.

16:24.775 --> 16:26.068
I'll kill all of you.

16:26.151 --> 16:27.778
220, this is 43.

16:27.861 --> 16:29.113
About 2917… Freeze!

16:29.196 --> 16:30.364
What?

16:30.447 --> 16:31.991
It's a misunderstanding.

16:32.074 --> 16:33.117
I have live rounds.

16:34.535 --> 16:35.828
Is that so? I get it.

16:37.162 --> 16:38.622
- You know how it is.
- Yes.

16:39.331 --> 16:41.667
Didn't we play soccer together? Left!

16:45.212 --> 16:46.672
Hey!

16:47.423 --> 16:48.298
Don't move.

16:51.468 --> 16:52.678
Hey!

16:53.262 --> 16:54.179
Hey, Si-eun!

16:54.763 --> 16:55.806
Where are you going?

17:30.382 --> 17:31.383
You scared me.

17:33.177 --> 17:36.013
Fuck, it's this bastard again.

17:36.597 --> 17:39.475
Hey, why are you following me, shithead?

17:48.776 --> 17:50.402
Fucking moron.

17:55.783 --> 17:57.534
You're so fucking annoying.

18:10.047 --> 18:11.340
How should I stab you?

18:17.554 --> 18:18.388
Hey!

18:26.688 --> 18:27.773
There's no other way.

18:28.607 --> 18:29.691
You need a good beating.

18:31.068 --> 18:33.445
Why do you keep fucking with me
in pairs today?

18:33.529 --> 18:35.656
Fucking bastards.

18:37.449 --> 18:38.492
Come on.

18:44.123 --> 18:45.082
Nice, fucker.

18:45.165 --> 18:46.542
Well, you're slow.

19:06.061 --> 19:07.146
- Asshole.
- Asshole.

19:23.287 --> 19:24.121
Hey!

19:53.025 --> 19:53.942
Hey!

19:54.026 --> 19:55.611
Are you out of your mind?

19:57.696 --> 19:59.448
Why did you go after him alone?

20:01.491 --> 20:02.701
You came, didn't you?

20:04.578 --> 20:06.205
That's seriously reckless.

20:06.872 --> 20:08.415
You're a total lunatic.

20:09.208 --> 20:10.125
You know that?

20:13.128 --> 20:14.880
Look who's talking.

20:17.090 --> 20:19.426
You always have to have the last word.

20:20.093 --> 20:21.136
If I were you,

20:22.137 --> 20:23.347
I'd just concede.

20:24.556 --> 20:25.515
Fucking lunatic.

20:43.784 --> 20:44.618
Come here!

20:51.124 --> 20:52.251
What are you doing?

20:52.334 --> 20:54.002
Hey, what are you doing?

20:55.045 --> 20:56.046
You go first.

20:56.129 --> 20:57.923
Don't fuck around. Come out!

20:58.006 --> 20:59.716
Fuck. Just listen to me!

21:02.261 --> 21:03.095
Go!

21:03.595 --> 21:04.805
It's not your fault.

21:07.766 --> 21:09.268
- Yeong-i, let's go.
- Hey!

21:10.018 --> 21:12.604
- Hurry!
- Hey! Fuck!

21:13.313 --> 21:14.815
You're so annoying!

21:14.898 --> 21:16.108
Hey! Jeon Seok-dae!

21:17.859 --> 21:18.694
Kid.

21:19.319 --> 21:20.404
Put your hands up.

21:21.947 --> 21:22.781
Hands up.

21:30.455 --> 21:31.790
I told you, didn't I? Fuck!

21:31.873 --> 21:33.417
- It's ridiculous!
- Quiet!

21:33.500 --> 21:36.211
What are you fucking doing?

21:46.763 --> 21:47.848
Hey, fucker.

21:49.975 --> 21:52.352
I'll see you when I get out, yeah?

22:03.864 --> 22:04.865
What's going on?

22:05.782 --> 22:08.160
Let's never see each other again, fucker.

22:13.248 --> 22:14.583
Oh, ox knee soup.

22:15.792 --> 22:17.878
I'm seriously so hungry.

22:17.961 --> 22:19.463
Ox knee soup, wow.

22:21.214 --> 22:23.050
Is this guy a bottomless pit?

22:23.133 --> 22:25.844
I can't get ox knee soup out of my head.

22:25.927 --> 22:28.972
I couldn't stop thinking about it.
And radish kimchi.

22:29.056 --> 22:30.307
Oh, there you are.

22:32.017 --> 22:32.934
What's this?

22:33.518 --> 22:35.103
Hey, you're alive!

22:35.937 --> 22:37.814
I thought you died!

22:37.898 --> 22:41.360
When you guys went after him,
I tried to find Si-eun's phone.

22:41.443 --> 22:43.779
It wasn't easy, and it took a while.

22:50.827 --> 22:52.496
The screen cracked a little.

22:54.039 --> 22:54.956
Thanks.

22:56.208 --> 22:57.459
Mr. Yeon Si-eun?

22:59.294 --> 23:01.505
Come with me to the station
to make a statement.

23:03.590 --> 23:04.591
You guys too.

23:08.970 --> 23:12.599
SEOUL SEOCHO POLICE STATION

23:12.682 --> 23:14.601
Shit, I told you everything!

23:14.684 --> 23:17.104
You're cutting off
the circulation to my wrists! Fuck!

23:39.042 --> 23:39.876
I'm sorry.

23:42.421 --> 23:43.255
What?

23:44.089 --> 23:45.090
You were right.

23:46.216 --> 23:47.551
Because of me, Su-ho…

23:49.511 --> 23:50.345
Sorry.

23:52.472 --> 23:53.890
Oh, no.

23:54.516 --> 23:55.350
Well,

23:55.892 --> 23:58.728
you got there late
because I took the taxi alone.

23:59.563 --> 24:00.439
I'm sorry too.

24:21.460 --> 24:23.253
I talked to the police chief.

24:23.879 --> 24:26.131
They won't be contacting
your family or the school.

24:27.132 --> 24:29.551
You two had nothing to do with this case.

24:32.095 --> 24:33.013
What?

24:36.099 --> 24:38.727
Si-eun, you must not say anything
to your family.

24:43.940 --> 24:45.025
You can leave now.

25:05.587 --> 25:06.421
Well…

25:09.132 --> 25:12.385
Besides Kim Gil-su,
the others did nothing wrong.

25:13.887 --> 25:15.680
He extorted and threatened them.

25:18.099 --> 25:20.519
I'd be grateful if you went easy on them.

25:27.067 --> 25:28.568
I see. Now, go on.

25:36.910 --> 25:39.663
Did you keep it a secret from my father?

25:40.664 --> 25:41.498
No.

25:43.124 --> 25:44.042
Let's go as well.

25:48.338 --> 25:49.256
No.

25:50.799 --> 25:53.301
I asked you to keep it a secret.

25:55.554 --> 25:56.429
We should go.

26:14.114 --> 26:15.115
Hey, dumbass.

26:20.245 --> 26:21.746
Let's get some food someday.

26:25.000 --> 26:26.543
You guys just love to eat.

26:58.199 --> 26:59.034
What is it?

27:02.412 --> 27:03.538
How's Seok-dae?

27:04.581 --> 27:05.915
He's being questioned.

27:09.836 --> 27:10.920
He'll be fine.

27:14.966 --> 27:15.884
And the others?

27:19.387 --> 27:20.889
I can't get a hold of them.

27:22.057 --> 27:23.350
Seong-chan went home.

27:29.147 --> 27:30.231
And you?

27:45.288 --> 27:46.122
Hey.

27:46.831 --> 27:47.957
What are you doing?

27:53.922 --> 27:56.383
The assemblyman
wanted you to pay him back.

27:57.509 --> 27:58.343
What?

27:59.135 --> 28:00.929
Hey, this is a police station.

28:01.971 --> 28:03.348
You can't beat me here.

28:03.431 --> 28:04.599
It's fine. Hit him.

28:05.809 --> 28:07.227
I'm okay.

28:08.603 --> 28:10.897
You morons are being fucking ridiculous.

28:18.029 --> 28:19.406
Stay still. Don't move.

28:20.949 --> 28:22.075
Watch carefully.

28:23.118 --> 28:25.704
One, two. Yeah? One, two.

28:29.040 --> 28:30.333
That hurts.

28:34.963 --> 28:37.215
Just imagine he's a punching bag.

28:38.341 --> 28:39.634
Okay. Hit me.

28:39.718 --> 28:42.178
Fuck. Hey, little puppy!

28:42.262 --> 28:44.472
Come fight me like your friends did.

28:44.556 --> 28:45.807
No, I got that wrong.

28:46.516 --> 28:48.727
You're not their friend.
You're just a lackey.

28:49.227 --> 28:52.647
You're a tiny bitch next to those punks.
You son of a--

28:52.731 --> 28:54.733
Okay, I get it, fucker.

28:54.816 --> 28:56.609
Hey, hit me.

28:57.444 --> 28:58.403
Hit me!

28:59.070 --> 29:00.989
Do it! Hit me!

29:30.351 --> 29:31.186
What?

29:37.776 --> 29:39.110
She wants to apologize.

29:40.236 --> 29:41.154
Hi!

29:44.741 --> 29:48.495
She… doesn't really sound like
she's apologizing.

29:49.996 --> 29:50.830
Sorry!

29:54.542 --> 29:55.877
Fucking idiot.

29:56.711 --> 29:57.712
How did it go?

29:59.547 --> 30:01.299
I don't know if it's good or not.

30:01.382 --> 30:03.426
Beom-seok's family covered it up.

30:03.510 --> 30:05.386
Our names were totally removed.

30:06.137 --> 30:07.222
Gil-su was arrested.

30:09.432 --> 30:12.685
Is Beom-seok's dad a CEO or something?

30:12.769 --> 30:16.981
A secretary or something came
and offered to pay my hospital fees.

30:17.065 --> 30:20.109
I said I was good,
but should I have taken it?

30:21.528 --> 30:23.738
He's National Assemblyman Oh Jin-won.

30:32.914 --> 30:34.207
How long are you in here?

30:35.458 --> 30:38.169
It's just a fracture,
so I can leave tomorrow.

30:39.587 --> 30:41.714
Can I crash here tonight?

30:41.798 --> 30:43.132
Whatever you want.

30:43.216 --> 30:44.217
Awesome!

30:46.845 --> 30:48.763
You were fucking awesome back there.

30:49.597 --> 30:50.640
I'm a badass.

30:50.723 --> 30:52.267
I got fucking goosebumps.

30:52.350 --> 30:54.102
"Hey, you bastards!"

30:55.436 --> 30:56.855
"Give me a break!"

30:56.938 --> 30:58.481
"Everyone, give me a break!"

30:59.190 --> 31:01.526
Lunatic! Why are you copying me?
Did you fall in love?

31:02.193 --> 31:03.194
Give me a break.

31:04.320 --> 31:06.155
Too bad. I'm with Si-eun.

31:10.451 --> 31:11.411
You're dating?

31:11.494 --> 31:12.912
You know that we aren't.

31:14.163 --> 31:15.456
You know that we are.

31:15.540 --> 31:17.667
We always know where the other is.

31:18.501 --> 31:21.754
That's only because of that app.

31:21.838 --> 31:24.048
You two look good together.
Just start dating.

31:24.132 --> 31:25.091
Give me a break.

31:27.427 --> 31:28.678
Seriously! Come on.

32:06.215 --> 32:07.383
What's this?

32:12.388 --> 32:13.264
What is this?

32:14.223 --> 32:15.266
You wanted it.

32:22.023 --> 32:24.025
If I eat at night, I'll get fat!

32:24.609 --> 32:25.485
Hey.

32:25.568 --> 32:27.654
Don't you know what time it is?

32:28.738 --> 32:30.865
You're really inconsiderate.

32:30.949 --> 32:33.785
You seem sincere though.

32:33.868 --> 32:35.036
It looks delicious.

32:35.787 --> 32:37.038
What is this feeling?

32:37.914 --> 32:39.415
I'm getting goosebumps.

32:40.458 --> 32:41.334
What is this?

32:43.336 --> 32:45.755
- What?
- It's just that you…

32:47.256 --> 32:49.467
You have such a warm heart.

32:49.550 --> 32:51.386
Yeah? Your eyes.

32:51.970 --> 32:53.680
Your behavior. Your words.

32:54.347 --> 32:55.515
Your expression.

32:56.975 --> 32:58.309
It feels strange, bro.

33:23.167 --> 33:24.002
Dig in.

33:49.902 --> 33:51.362
You're a mind reader.

33:59.829 --> 34:05.960
I'm not only an assemblyman
but an adult and a father myself,

34:06.044 --> 34:09.714
so it was only natural to be interested
in policies concerning teenagers.

34:31.903 --> 34:33.112
What are you waiting for?

34:46.751 --> 34:50.296
I shouldn't have taken you in.

34:51.839 --> 34:52.715
You…

34:55.802 --> 34:57.970
are a bad seed.

34:59.972 --> 35:00.807
You know that.

37:44.053 --> 37:45.805
ALL NAMES, PLACES, AND EVENTS SHOWN
ARE FICTIONAL

37:45.888 --> 37:47.348
ANY SIMILARITY TO REALITY IS COINCIDENTAL

37:47.848 --> 37:51.185
Subtitle translation by: James Webb
